  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance for Growth - Sri Lanka (first phase)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the first Governance for Growth (G4G) investment is to support accountable and equitable governance institutions. It works with Sri Lankan national ministries, subnational institutions, and other partners to support their ability to plan and deliver effective, efficient public services. The investment also focuses on overcoming the barriers to participation for women and people with disabilities in the governance process.</narrative>
  </description>
